<title>USA: Apache files for $300 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Apache files for $300 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apache Corp filed a shelf registration Wednesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $300 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The company said it will use net proceeds to refinance debt and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>It did not name underwriters.</p>
</text>
